# Platform — Cron Chatbot Balance Poll Trigger
# M19-S08: publishes the cron-chatbot-balance-poll trigger, dispatched to
# ChatbotBalancePollTriggerHandler. In production, Cloud Scheduler publishes the same trigger
# directly to Pub/Sub every 15 minutes — this endpoint is the local/manual trigger path only,
# protected by the global InternalApiGuard (X-Internal-Key), not PubSubPushGuard.
# Response is { ok: true } once the trigger is published — it does not wait for the job to
# finish. Requires the Pub/Sub emulator running (pnpm infra:up).
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev

@baseUrl = {{backendUrl}}

### POST /cron/chatbot-balance-poll — publish the OpenRouter balance-poll trigger
POST {{baseUrl}}/cron/chatbot-balance-poll
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

###
